DESCRIPTION:Fenner Ride 2026 is a supported road cycling ride starting at 
 the Clyde L. Gracey Community Center\, 5629 Byrom Street in Milton\, with
  four routes: an 18-mile family ride\, 44.6 miles\, 64.5 miles and a 100.
 3-mile century. The routes use the Blackwater Heritage State Trail. Regis
 tration includes supported rest stops\, limited sag support\, giveaways\,
  a post-ride meal from Sonny's BBQ and prize opportunities\, and all proc
 eeds benefit Big Brothers Big Sisters of Northwest Florida.\nPrice: from 
